        "id": "u1",
        "title": {
          "ru": "Родительный множественного",
          "en": "Genitive plural"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en": "After five, много, нет and сколько: -ов, -ей or a zero ending."
        },
        "cards": [
          {
            "id": "h2f01-u1-c01",
            "kind": "explain",
            "title": {
              "ru": "Три окончания",
              "en": "Three endings"
            },
            "body": "Корпус А1, этаж 6 taught the genitive singular after нет. At A2 the same triggers take the PLURAL: пять, много, нет, сколько.\nMasculine nouns take -ов (студентов, домов); nouns in a soft sign or a hushing consonant take -ей (людей, детей).\nFeminine and neuter nouns usually drop their ending (писем, сестёр), often with a fleeting vowel.\n",
            "examples": [
              {
                "sentenceRef": {
                  "storyId": "u1-ex",
                  "sentenceId": "h2f01u1-s001"
                },
                "highlight": [
                  "студентов"
                ]
              },
              {
                "sentenceRef": {
                  "storyId": "u1-ex",
                  "sentenceId": "h2f01u1-s002"
                },
                "highlight": [
                  "денег"
                ]
              },
              {
                "sentenceRef": {
                  "storyId": "u1-ex",
                  "sentenceId": "h2f01u1-s003"
                },
                "highlight": [
                  "людей"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "h2f01-u1-c02",
            "kind": "check",
            "items": [
              "u1-k01"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "h2f01-u1-c03",
            "kind": "traps",
            "title": {
              "ru": "Ловушки",
              "en": "Traps"
            },
            "pairs": [
              {
                "wrong": "В группе пять студенты.",
                "right": {
                  "storyId": "u1-ex",
                  "sentenceId": "h2f01u1-s001"
                },
                "reason": "after пять the noun is genitive plural: студентов"
              },
              {
                "wrong": "На улице много люди.",
                "right": {
                  "storyId": "u1-ex",
                  "sentenceId": "h2f01u1-s003"
                },
                "reason": "after много the noun is genitive plural: людей"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "h2f01-u1-c04",
            "kind": "edge",
            "title": {
              "ru": "Тонкости",
              "en": "Edge cases"
            },
            "body": "Two, three and four take the genitive SINGULAR (три письма), five and up the genitive plural (пять писем).\nThe fleeting vowel appears in the zero ending: письмо → писем, сестра → сестёр, деньги → денег.\n",
            "examples": [
              {
                "sentenceRef": {
                  "storyId": "u1-ex",
                  "sentenceId": "h2f01u1-s004"
                },
                "highlight": [
                  "письма",
                  "писем"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
